OL,3,GNEWSAMum sentenced for killing her
OL,4,Athree children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who admitted killing her three
OL,7,Fchildren at their family home has been
OL,8,Fsentenced to an indefinite hospital
OL,9,Forder in a secure psychiatric facility.
OL,11,FThe bodies of Fares Bash, seven, Joury
OL,12,FBash, three, and nine-month-old
OL,13,FMohammed Bash were discovered on Blaise
OL,14,FWalk in Sea Mills, Bristol, on 18
OL,15,FFebruary 2024.
OL,17,FAppearing at Bristol Crown Court
OL,18,Fearlier, Yasmeen Ali, 44, admitted
OL,19,Fthree charges of manslaughter as her
OL,20,Fdefence said she was suffering from an
OL,21,F"acute psychosis". She wept as details
OL,22,Fof their fatal injuries were read out.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
